.TH "" "" "" ""
.SH OpenStatus CLI
.SS CLI interface \- openstatus
OpenStatus CLI lets you manage your status pages and uptime monitors
from the command line.
Declare and run incidents, post public status updates, define monitors
as code, and run on\-demand checks.
Get started: openstatus login Save your API token openstatus incident
declare Declare an incident openstatus incident list View incidents
openstatus status\-report create Post a public status update openstatus
status\-report list View status reports openstatus maintenance create
Schedule a maintenance window openstatus maintenance list View
maintenance windows openstatus monitors apply Sync monitors from config
openstatus monitors list List your monitors openstatus run Run synthetic
tests openstatus pl list List your private locations
https://docs.openstatus.dev |
https://github.com/openstatusHQ/cli/issues/new.
.PP
Manage status pages, monitors, and incidents from the terminal.
.PP
Usage:
.IP
.EX
$ openstatus [GLOBAL FLAGS] [COMMAND] [COMMAND FLAGS] [ARGUMENTS...]
.EE
.PP
Global flags:
.PP
